description.narrative:
Objectives of the intervention
The ASCE-LC aims at becoming a well functionning organisation. The intended outcome of this intervention is to make available new tools through trainings for professionalism and the developement of the communication. The state controllers performance is improved. The global objective of this contribution is to reinforce ASCE-LC by providing new approaches, capacity strengthening and communication. The specific objectives are three in number with ultimate results, intermediate results to reach through indicators : Compared to the initial project documents, an assessment of the project implementation approach implies to review the implementation framework for better consistency with the results-based management approach. Thus, the revision of the logical framework led to the revision of the objectives and expected results of the project. The project architecture and the chain of expected project results were then redefined as follows:
Ultimate result: The ASCE-LC Organizational Strengthening Project envisages contributing to the achievement of the following ultimate result: "The level of corruption in Burkina Faso is reduced". The ASCE-LC Organizational Strengthening Project targets two (02) intermediate results and seven (07) immediate results. It's about:
Intermediate result 1: The professionalization of ASCE-LC control and anti-corruption missions is improved To achieve this result, four (04) immediate results are defined: Immediate result 1.1: Increased capacity of ASCE-LC in strategic management in the context of the fight against corruption; Immediate result 1.2: Increased access of state controllers to modern gender-sensitive tools for audit, control and the fight against corruption; Immediate Result 1.3: Improved capacity of the ASCE-LC business body in terms of audit, control and the fight against corruption; Immediate Result 1.4: Institutional visibility of ASCE-LC improved;
Intermediate result 2: Improved prevention of corrupt practices and similar offenses in public administrations For the achievement of this second intermediate result, three (03) immediate results are defined: Immediate Result 2.1: The Communication from ASCE-LC on the fight against corruption is strengthened; Immediate Result 2.2: The Coordination capacities for the fight against corruption is strengthened with partner structures; Immediate result 2.3: Improved capacities of partner for the popularization of anticorruption messages;
